  "scope": "The six production tank requests (Protection, Holy Protection and Ret Protection Paladin, Feral (bear) Druid, Protection and Fury Protection Warrior) against 2, 3, 4 and 5 copies of the boss, which Go has all swing at the tank on their own timers, and the eight Protection and Fury Protection Warrior requests the application built for the earlier multi-target record (application revision 3923f70de), exported with the pinned Go engine and run by Go and Rust. The Paladin and bear requests are the ones that record could not run: the exporter refused them as tank assignments with several targets.",
