    "Each copy swings at the tank from its own timer and reset roll. Go lists the swings in unit index order, the targets first, and runs the ones due at one time in that order. A parry from the tank pulls in only its own swing, a Thunder Clap slows only the copies it lands on, and Demoralizing Roar cuts the attack power of each copy it lands on; a block reaches Holy Shield and Eye for an Eye and a hit reaches Retaliation, the Immolation of Sulfuras and an item's damage shield with the copy that swung as the unit they answer."
